---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ThemeNote from "../components/ThemeNote.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import { dailyDate } from "../lib/content";

const reports = (await getCollection("daily")).sort((a, b) => dailyDate(b.id).localeCompare(dailyDate(a.id)));
const latestDate = reports[0] ? dailyDate(reports[0].id) : "2026-08-11";
---

<BaseLayout active="home">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Personal Journal · Since 2017</p>
    <h1>把技术、远方与日常，<br />写成可以慢慢翻阅的纸。</h1>
    <p class="lede">这里收纳 GitHub 开源生态的每日观察，也保存旅行之前，那些考古学式的案头研究。</p>
  </section>

  <ThemeNote />

  <section class="issue-list" aria-labelledby="latest-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Latest Issues</p>
      <h2 id="latest-heading">近来所写</h2>
    </div>
    <article class="feature-entry">
      <div class="entry-index">01</div>
      <div>
        <p class="entry-meta">{latestDate} · 技术 × 产品 × 投资</p>
        <h3><a href={`/github-daily/${latestDate}/`}>GitHub Trending 日报</a></h3>
        <p>从代码仓库、产品信号与投资叙事三条线索，观察开源生态正在发生的变化。</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/github-daily/">翻阅最近日报 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-entry">
      <div class="entry-index">02</div>
      <div>
        <p class="entry-meta">2026-05 · Travel Research</p>
        <h3><a href="/japan-research/">日本旅行研究素材</a></h3>
        <p>从博物馆、寺院、城市遗产与历史分层出发，为抵达日本之前准备一份厚实的上下文。</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/japan-research/">进入研究目录 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
